ed_at":"2026-10-01T15:58:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7 dev a9afde8\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nSee steps.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Open both scenes\n3. Switch to `my_inherited_scene`\n4. Open `my_base_scene` in external editor and make any valid change\n5. Go back to Godot and when prompted to reload, select \"Ignore External Changes\"\n6. You will end up with base scene opened twice\n\n<img width=\"444\" height=\"121\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/154e69a0-b080-4988-8446-942dc4955efe\" />\n\nThe editor will show changes dialog on every focus, with no way to resolve it.\n7. If you go back to the external editor, the base scene's content is overwritten by the inherited scene\n8. When you switch scene tabs, the editor may crash (I was not able to catch stack trace)\n9. Both scenes can no longer be opened\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[scene-inheritance-anchors.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26037531/scene-inheritance-anchors.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co